main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ parentheses: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ empty braces: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ aggregate elements: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ list: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ class: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
